WEBVTT

00:06:59.039 --> 00:07:04.753
Indeed, there are many
employers and politicians

00:07:04.753 --> 00:07:08.340
who are preventing
the reform of labor laws

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:12.386
passed nearly a century ago in another era

00:07:12.428 --> 00:07:14.305
and another economy.

00:07:16.765 --> 00:07:18.017
These are laws

00:07:18.017 --> 00:07:23.731
that inhibit agriculture and domestic
workers from organizing,

00:07:23.731 --> 00:07:25.983
largely Black and brown workers.

00:07:26.025 --> 00:07:31.363
They make it hard for workers
in the gig economy to organize,